# Compatibility aliases that a live fleet still calls.
# One exact tracked path per line, with the caller that still calls it and the
# slice that deletes it. This list may only shrink; slice S10 deletes every
# entry below and then this file.
#
# The compatibility layer itself: every legacy spelling the fleet still reads
# lives here, so no other tracked file needs to keep one.
bin/jg-compat.sh  # slice S1 compatibility layer; deleted by slice S10
#
# Archival record of the two retired repositories: the branch and pull request
# links it preserves must keep their historical names.
